{"kind":"hit","probe":"any_gateway","point":"after","method":"Main.pay(Gateway[], Base)","call":1,"parent":null,"thread":{"id":1,"name":"main"},"pid":1,"ts":"<masked>","what":{"ret":"paypal"}}
{"kind":"hit","probe":"stripe_only","point":"after","method":"Main.pay(Gateway[], Base)","call":1,"parent":null,"thread":{"id":1,"name":"main"},"pid":1,"ts":"<masked>","what":{"ret":"stripe"}}
{"kind":"hit","probe":"any_gateway","point":"after","method":"Main.pay(Gateway[], Base)","call":1,"parent":null,"thread":{"id":1,"name":"main"},"pid":1,"ts":"<masked>","what":{"ret":"stripe"}}
